  "description": "Weekly AI Roundup: Codex Safety, Claude Opus 4.7, GPT-5.5 & Cyber Updates\n\nAfter watching, you\u2019ll know what each update enables in practice. what autonomous coding agents can do in real projects, how Trusted Contact and Cybersecurity governance affect risk and deployment, what new voice-models in the API enable for real-time apps, and how to evaluate adoption with concrete checklists for governance, privacy, and integration. Every story is kept short and evidence-first \u2014 no hype, no padding.\n\n\ud83d\udccc Chapters:\n0:00 Intro\n0:35 Story 1\n2:05 Story 2\n3:15 Story 3\n4:20 Story 4\n5:30 Story 5\n6:30 Story 6\n7:30 Story 7\n8:15 Story 8\n8:45 Takeaway\n9:30 Wrap Up\n\n\ud83d\udcda Sources:\n- https://openai.com/index/advancing-voice-intelligence-with-new-models-in-the-api\n- https://openai.com/index/gpt-5-5-with-trusted-access-for-cyber\n- https://openai.com/index/introducing-trusted-contact-in-chatgpt\n- https://openai.com/index/uber\n- https://openai.com/index/parloa\n- https://openai.com/index/running-codex-safely\n- https://openai.com/index/testing-ads-in-chatgpt\n- https://www.anthropic.com/news/claude-opus-4-7\n\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nAI Signal Brief publishes evidence-first AI news analysis.\nNo hype. Just verified facts and what they mean for you.",
